# Human-in-the-Loop Modal Schema Template `[🤖 AGENT]`

> **Audience:** `🤖 Agent / Autonomous` &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Format:** JSON Schema

---

```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "GenericApprovalModal",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["decision", "reviewerNotes"],
  "properties": {
    "decision": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["APPROVE", "REJECT", "REQUEST_CHANGES"],
      "title": "Review Decision",
      "description": "Select the appropriate authorization outcome."
    },
    "reviewerNotes": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 5,
      "title": "Reviewer Notes & Rationale",
      "description": "Provide context for this decision for the audit log."
    },
    "adjustments": {
      "type": "object",
      "title": "Manual Parameter Overrides (Optional)",
      "additionalProperties": true
    }
  }
}
```
